-> Test: native module exports a type and handler.
link native_modules/libtest_math.so as math

-> Create a Point particle using the native type declaration.
p = math.Point { x = 3, y = 4 }
assert p.x = 3
assert p.y = 4

-> Dispatch to the native handler — it returns a Point with a "sum" field.
emit p to math get result
assert result.sum = 7
assert result.x = 3
assert result.y = 4
